# This repository holds the structure of the set, its index, and the install runbook with its presets.
# Every unit is a repository of its own in the folders below, never tracked here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/README.*.md
!/STRUCTURE.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/presets.toml
!/docs/
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/privacy-scan/
